{
  "$comment": "The five surfaces, as the preview wall frames them. `launch` names the entry in .claude/launch.json that serves each one; `pnpm preview` fails if a port here disagrees with that file. width/height are the device viewport the surface is designed for -- the wall renders at that size and scales down, so a small tile still shows the layout the real device gets. span is how many of the wall's six grid columns the cell claims.",
